# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# Bustfile — Failure-mode and recovery verification for developer-ecosystem
# Author: Jonathan D.A. Jewell <j.d.a.jewell@open.ac.uk>

@abstract:
Failure modes and recovery paths for the developer-ecosystem monorepo.
Every declared failure mode must have a verifiable recovery path.
Hard gate: missing or broken recovery blocks merge.
@end

## CI Failures

### ci-workflow-missing
- description: Missing required workflow files
- class: crash
- injection: "mv .github/workflows/ci.yml .github/workflows/ci.yml.bak 2>/dev/null; true"
- recovery: "test -f .github/workflows/ci.yml || mv .github/workflows/ci.yml.bak .github/workflows/ci.yml 2>/dev/null; test -f .github/workflows/ci.yml"
- severity: critical
- notes: Recovery = restore from git; injection is dry-run conceptual only

### hypatia-scan-missing
- description: Hypatia scan workflow removed
- class: crash
- injection: "echo 'injection dry-run only'"
- recovery: "test -f .github/workflows/hypatia-scan.yml"
- severity: critical

## Monorepo Integrity

### machine-readable-deleted
- description: .machine_readable/ directory accidentally deleted
- class: crash
- injection: "echo 'injection dry-run only'"
- recovery: "test -d .machine_readable/6a2 && test -f .machine_readable/6a2/STATE.a2ml"
- severity: critical

### justfile-removed
- description: Root Justfile deleted
- class: crash
- injection: "echo 'injection dry-run only'"
- recovery: "test -f Justfile"
- severity: critical

## License Compliance

### license-file-removed
- description: Root LICENSE file removed
- class: crash
- injection: "echo 'injection dry-run only'"
- recovery: "test -f LICENSE"
- severity: critical

## Dependency Failures

### deno-json-malformed
- description: Root deno.json becomes invalid JSON
- class: partial_write
- injection: "echo 'injection dry-run only'"
- recovery: "python3 -c 'import json; json.load(open(\"deno.json\"))' 2>/dev/null && echo OK || echo FAIL"
- severity: warning
